# Fusion Docs — project context

Official **Fusion Framework** docs site (Cipher Unit). Single Next.js app — **not** a monorepo / Electron app.

## Stack

| Piece | Detail |
| --- | --- |
| Runtime | Next.js **16** App Router, React **19**, React Compiler |
| Docs | Fumadocs (MDX, search, UI) |
| i18n | Fumadocs i18n + i18next; locales `en` / `fa` (RTL) / `ru` |
| Style | Tailwind CSS **4**, tokens in `src/app/styles/globals.css`, shadcn (`components.json`) + Base UI |
| Tooling | pnpm **11.5.2**, TypeScript strict, ESLint, Husky |
| Aliases | `@/*` → `src/*`, `@content/*` → `content/*` |

Config entry points: `next.config.mjs`, `tsconfig.json`, `postcss.config.mjs`, `components.json`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (build allows only — not packages).

## Folder roles

```text
content/docs/{en,fa,ru}/…   # MDX docs (en = source of truth)
content/locales/{en,fa,ru}/ # UI JSON (common, fumadocs-ui, gui, home, seo)
src/app/[lang]/…            # Routes: home, docs, gui, og, api/search
src/components/             # docs/, gui/, home/, ui/
src/lib/                    # i18n, source, docs helpers, SEO, layout
public/                     # fonts, images
.agents/skills/             # Agent skills (authoritative workflows)
.cursor/rules/ + skills/    # Cursor rules; skills mirror/subset of .agents
```

Products under docs: `architecture`, `cli`, `python`, `typescript`, `csharp` (versioned `v1/`).

Key modules: `src/lib/i18n.ts`, `locales-registry.ts`, `source.ts`, `docs.ts`, `layout.shared.tsx`, `src/proxy.ts`.

## Conventions

- **Tri-lingual content**: same relative path under `en` / `fa` / `ru`; align `meta.json` `pages[]`.
- **Package names**: `fusion-framework` (PyPI/npm), `fusion_framework` / `FusionFramework`, NuGet `Fusion-Framework`, CLI from `fusion-tool`. Do not invent APIs.
- **Links**: include product version segment (`v1`).
- **UI**: functional React/RSC; `cn()` + CVA variants; colors via CSS vars / Tailwind token classes from `globals.css` — no hardcoded HEX/RGB/HSL.
- **Commits**: branch off `main` (`feat/` / `fix/` / `docs/` / `i18n/`); before PR run `pnpm check` and `pnpm build`.
- Guides: root `README.md`, `DEVELOPING.md`, `TRANSLATING.md`.

## Must-know

1. Translators stay in `content/`; app work spans `src/` + config.
2. Locales are discovered from `content/locales/meta.json`.
3. Prefer verifying framework behavior against `fusion-framework` / `fusion-tool` sources before documenting.
4. For agent workflows and deeper rules, **always check `.agents`** (below) — do not rely on this file alone.

